1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,400
M: I want to start investing some money toward my retirement years, but I am not sure what would be best.

2
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:08,800
Didn't you tell me that you know of someone who was working in the field?

3
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:11,580
W: Yes, my brother is an investment manager.

4
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,460
He helps people make the right investment choices.

5
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:17,560
Do you want me to call him and set up an appointment for you?

6
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:18,280
M: Yes.

7
00:00:18,765 --> 00:00:19,160
Can you?

8
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:22,405
I would really appreciate it if you could do it right away.

9
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:28,750
In fact, I am going to be in my office all day today, so do you think you could have him call me directly here?

10
00:00:28,985 --> 00:00:33,920
W: Sorry, Jack, but he went out of town on business and won't be coming back until late this evening.

11
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:36,740
I will give him a shout the first thing tomorrow morning.
